### Windows Computer Name APIs (Windows :XP only, v1)

# Prerequisite: device enrolled with MAC suffix :XP and admin logged in (@adminToken).
# Inline JSON in functionParameter (Keyboard parity — NOT compact ref like 802.1X above).
# Two FusionX module names: Host Name (host rename) and DomainSettings (domain/workgroup join).
# Pending tasks are independent per module — a pending Host Name task does not block DomainSettings.
# GET current redacts password as ******** (write-only; agent payload still includes password).
# Task pipeline: FunctionName=Now (instant) / Update (queued), ExtraData signal suffix CN.

@compNameMac = 00-11-22-33-44-55:XP

