### Windows Region & Location APIs (Windows :XP only, v1)

# FusionX: System Settings → Time and Language → Region and Location tab.
# Inline JSON in functionParameter (WinCELinux.RegionAndLocation) — no hydration.
# module_name=Region And Location Settings, signal suffix RLS (default).
# Validate geo/language via PR1 reference APIs before apply:
#   GET .../time-and-language/reference/locations (Identifier L, excludes World/39070)
#   GET .../time-and-language/reference/regions (Identifier R, includes bcp47Code)
# Pending task for the SAME module_name blocks re-apply (409 ApplyBlocked); DateTime/TimeZone tasks do not block.

