### Windows Regional Format APIs (Windows :XP only, v1)

# FusionX: System Settings → Time and Language → Date & Time Format tab.
# Inline JSON in functionParameter (WinCELinux.RegionalSettings) — no hydration.
# module_name=Regional Settings, signal suffix RS (default).
# Agent JSON uses FusionX spelling: strTimeSeperator, strDateSeperator (not American "Separator").
# strMinyear / strMaxyear always empty in payload; TimeSample is stored only (not sent to agent).
# Optional presets: GET .../time-and-language/reference/format-presets
# Pending task for the SAME module_name blocks re-apply (409 ApplyBlocked); PR2/PR3 tasks do not block.

@regionalFormatMac = 00-11-22-33-44-55:XP

