### Windows Wireless Properties — Agent ack completed
POST {{Intellinode.Api_HostAddress}}/api/v1/agents/tasks/ack
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{agentToken}}

{
  "acknowledgements": [
    {
      "taskId": "{{wirelessTaskId}}",
      "legacyTaskId": {{wirelessLegacyTaskId}},
      "status": "Completed"
    }
  ]
}

# Expected: add/update → pendingApply=false, lastAppliedVersion set
# delete ack → profile row removed from GET list


